### create poolParticipant

POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_ref": {{userID}},
    "pool_ref": {{poolId}},
    "payment_ref": {{paymentId}},
    "delivery_ref": {{deliveryId}},
    "quantity": 15
}

### list poolParticipants

GET {{baseUrl}}

### get poolParticipant by id

GET {{baseUrl}}/{{poolParticipantId}}

### update poolParticipant

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{poolParticipantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "quantity": 12
}

### delete pool

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{poolParticipantId}}


